      en: ["Constructed in 1748 during the Spanish colonial period.", "Originally served as a storage facility for gunpowder (La Pólvora).", "Features six massive circular watchtowers at the corners.", "Used as a prison facility during the 20th-century Somoza regime.", "Located at the western end of Calle Real Xalteva in Granada.", "Provides a panoramic view of the Mombacho Volcano from its ramparts."],
