      en: ["The poet Rubén Darío was born here on January 18, 1867.", "Metapa was officially renamed Ciudad Darío on February 25, 1920.", "The house was converted into a museum in 1943 to preserve Darío's memory.", "It contains the original wooden cradle used by the poet's family.", "The structure is an authentic example of 'casa de taquezal' construction.", "The site is the starting point for the annual national poetry marathon."],
